<p id="A2.SS2.p4.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.p4.4.1" class="ltx_text">where we use Lemma <a href="#A1.Thmlem5" title="Lemma A.5 ( [ , Theorem 2.1.5] ). ‣ Appendix A Supporting Lemmas ‣ Stochastic Bilevel Optimization with Heavy-Tailed Noise" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.5</span></a> to show that</span></p>
